            B.q("ai-m2-4", "ai-appservice-containers", "The team wants an OpenTelemetry Collector (a small program that gathers telemetry and forwards it) running next to the API, without building it into the API image. What do you use?", listOf("A second App Service plan that runs only the collector", "A WebJob that starts the collector process", "Install the collector with apt-get in the API's Dockerfile", "A sidecar container added to the app in Deployment Center, which the API reaches on localhost"), setOf(3), "Sidecar containers run alongside the main container of a Linux app on the same plan. They share its network, so the main container reaches them on localhost, and app settings are available to every container. An app has one main container and up to nine sidecars.",
                scenario = "Tailspin Tours runs its booking API as a custom Linux container on App Service. Its Android app calls this API, and the team now wants traces sent to Azure Monitor.",
