            B.q("ai-m2-6", "ai-appservice-containers", "What happens when you save the change? Select two.", listOf("App Service rebuilds the image in the registry", "The app restarts, so each container starts again", "The new value reaches the container as an environment variable", "Only instances added by a later scale-out see the new value"), setOf(1, 2), "App settings are injected into the container as environment variables when it starts. Adding, removing or editing an app setting makes App Service restart the app, so every instance's container starts again with the new values.",
