            B.q("ai-m2-8", "ai-container-apps", "What must you do so the apps can reach the server?", listOf("Add the virtual network to the existing environment in its Networking settings", "Create a new environment in a subnet of the company's virtual network, and deploy the apps there", "Turn on internal ingress for each app", "Create a new revision of each app"), setOf(1), "A Container Apps environment's network is decided when the environment is created. You cannot attach a virtual network to an existing environment later, so you create a new environment in your own virtual network (a subnet you give it) and move the apps.",
