            B.q("ai-m2-10", "ai-aks", "How should the Deployment manifest supply the value?", listOf("ENV TRACKING_REGION=eu in the Dockerfile", "A label on the pod template", "An annotation on the Deployment", "A ConfigMap holding the value, read by the container through env valueFrom configMapKeyRef (or envFrom)"), setOf(3), "A ConfigMap holds non-secret settings as key-value pairs in the cluster, and a container reads them as environment variables through configMapKeyRef or envFrom. After you change the ConfigMap, restart the pods (for example kubectl rollout restart deployment/parcel-api) and they pick up the new value without a new image.",
