            B.q("ai-m2-12", "ai-aks", "Which kind of object do you put in the manifest?", listOf("A CronJob with schedule \"0 2 * * *\"", "A Deployment with replicas: 1", "A DaemonSet", "A Service of type ClusterIP"), setOf(0), "A CronJob creates a Job on a cron schedule (minute, hour, day of month, month, day of week), and the Job runs its pod until the work completes. 0 2 * * * means 02:00 every day.",
