            B.q("ai-m2-13", "ai-container-troubleshoot", "kubectl describe pod shows the event FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. What do you do?", listOf("Attach the registry with az aks update --attach-acr", "Lower the pods' CPU requests, or add capacity: scale the node pool or turn on the cluster autoscaler", "Add a liveness probe", "Change the image tag"), setOf(1), "Pending with Insufficient cpu means no node has enough unreserved CPU left for the pod's request. Either ask for less CPU, or give the cluster more room by adding nodes, by hand or with the cluster autoscaler, which adds nodes when pods cannot be placed.",
