            B.q("ai-m2-20", "ai-cosmos-vector", "Results from the new vector search are nonsense, although the query and vector policy look right. What is the most likely cause?", listOf("The stored item embeddings and the question embedding came from different embedding models", "The container uses Session consistency", "The query uses TOP 5 instead of TOP 10", "The partition key is /userId"), setOf(0), "Each embedding model places meaning in its own space, often with its own number of dimensions. Vectors are only comparable when the stored ones and the query one come from the same model, so a model change means re-embedding the stored items.",
