            B.q("ai-m2-27", "ai-postgres", "Heavy monthly reports slow down the database the app uses. The reports can show data a few seconds old. What helps without changing the app's writes?", listOf("Raise max_connections", "Move the reports to a separate database on the same server", "Turn off autovacuum during reports", "Create a read replica and point the reporting job at the replica's endpoint"), setOf(3), "A read replica is a read-only copy kept up to date asynchronously. Sending heavy reads there takes the load off the primary server, and the small replication lag is acceptable for reports.",
