            B.q("ai-m2-33", "ai-redis", "The home screen needs 40 cached values and the API sends 40 separate GET commands one after another, each waiting for its reply. What cuts the latency most?", listOf("Fetch them in one round trip with MGET (or a client pipeline)", "Give every key a longer expiry", "Move the cache to the Flash Optimized tier", "Call FLUSHALL before building the screen"), setOf(0), "Each command that waits for its reply pays a network round trip. MGET reads many keys in one command, and a pipeline sends many commands before reading the replies, so 40 round trips become one.",
