            B.q("ai-m2-48", "ai-keyvault", "Auditors require that nobody, not even a vault administrator, can permanently destroy a deleted secret before the retention period ends. What do you turn on?", listOf("A ReadOnly resource lock on the vault", "The Key Vault Administrator role for the security team only", "Purge protection on the vault", "A 7-day soft-delete retention period"), setOf(2), "Soft delete keeps a deleted secret recoverable for the retention period (7 to 90 days). Purge protection adds the rule that nothing can be purged, meaning deleted for good, until that period ends, even by administrators. Once it is on, it cannot be turned off.",
