            B.q("ai-m2-50", "ai-keyvault", "The vault must be reachable only from the backend's virtual network, never over the public internet. Which two actions do you take? Select two.", listOf("Give the API's identity the Key Vault Secrets Officer role", "Create a private endpoint for the vault in the virtual network", "Enable purge protection", "Set the vault's public network access to Disabled"), setOf(1, 3), "A private endpoint gives the vault a private IP address inside the virtual network, and disabling public network access refuses every call that does not arrive that way. Roles decide what an identity may do; networking decides where calls may come from.",
