            B.q("ai-m2-52", "ai-appconfig", "The API loads two selectors in this order: Quiz:* with no label, then Quiz:* with the label prod. Quiz:MaxTokens is 2000 with no label and 800 with prod. Which value does the production API see?", listOf("2000, because values with no label always win", "800, because a later selector overrides keys loaded by an earlier one", "Both values, returned as a list", "An error, because the key appears twice"), setOf(1), "The provider applies selectors in order, and when the same key comes back from more than one selector, the later one wins. Loading shared defaults with no label first and the environment's label second is the usual way to override only what differs.",
