            B.q("ai-m2-53", "ai-appconfig", "Before each release the team wants a frozen copy of the settings it tested, and production must load exactly that copy. Which two statements about App Configuration snapshots are true? Select two.", listOf("A snapshot can be edited in place to fix one value", "Loading a snapshot also needs a label_filter on the same selector", "A snapshot is immutable: later edits to the keys do not change it", "The app loads it with SettingSelector(snapshot_name=\"release-7\")"), setOf(2, 3), "A snapshot is a named, unchangeable set of key-values captured at one moment. The Python provider loads it by name with a snapshot selector, so production gets exactly the set that was tested, whatever has changed in the store since.",
