            B.q("ai-m2-60", "ai-kql", "The same two-hour window and role name appear in three parts of a long query. How do you define them once and reuse them?", listOf("extend window = 2h at the top of the query", "project window = 2h at the top of the query", "let window = 2h; let role = \"bd-api\"; before the query, then use window and role in each part", "set window = 2h; before the query"), setOf(2), "let binds a name to a value, a table or a function at the start of a query, and every later statement can use it, so a change in one place changes every use.",
